# Schoolwell — Roo Code / Cline Rules

You are working on Schoolwell — an Indian school management system (frontend only).

## STRICT RULES
1. Do NOT change folder structure or architecture
2. Do NOT rewrite entire files — surgical diffs only
3. Do NOT use TypeScript `any` — project is strict mode
4. Do NOT install packages without approval
5. Do NOT create backend/API code — another dev handles that
6. Do NOT change state management (useSyncExternalStore pattern)
7. All mutations go through repository.ts ONLY
8. Use existing UI Primitives from components/ui/Primitives.tsx
9. Use CSS custom properties (--school-forest, --school-gold, etc.)
10. All 48 tests must continue passing after changes

## MASTER INSTRUCTIONS
Read FRONTEND_AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md and PROJECT_RULES.md at project root for full architecture and implementation standards. Every frontend change must follow the guidelines in FRONTEND_AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md.
